{"4800860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Peerless Beauty Detective: Alice", "steam_appid": 4800860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A murder occurred at the Ai Qing Apartment. The female owner of Apartment 1802 died strangely. There was no struggle, no signs of a fight. Why did she die at night? Why wasn't the male owner at home? All the mysteries await the detective: Alice to solve. There is only one truth, let's find it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/c1adf74e3a648b94d58d2d573afdbc1c.poster.avif?t=1784868679\" width=1170 height=746 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/c1adf74e3a648b94d58d2d573afdbc1c.webm?t=1784868679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/c1adf74e3a648b94d58d2d573afdbc1c.mp4?t=1784868679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>[<strong>Gameplay</strong>]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 Use the W, A, S, D keys to control the character movement, and use the mouse to change the perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 Press ESC to open the settings, T to view the tasks, M to view the messages, and F for interaction/viewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 After entering the game, you need to check the tasks and messages to decide what to do. The tasks and messages will give you hints to help you find people or clues. Once found, you can press F to interact with the characters or objects and use them. Completing all the puzzles is your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/4549ea1d1db5f8c58cfbe8a5bbe2d61d.poster.avif?t=1784868679\" width=1170 height=746 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/4549ea1d1db5f8c58cfbe8a5bbe2d61d.webm?t=1784868679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/4549ea1d1db5f8c58cfbe8a5bbe2d61d.mp4?t=1784868679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Game Features</strong>]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 Smooth and excellent third-person controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 Theme-appropriate background music (BGM).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 Progressive achievement unlocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠 Experience the sense of accomplishment when solving puzzles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A murder occurred at the Ai Qing Apartment. The female owner of Apartment 1802 died strangely. There was no struggle, no signs of a fight. Why did she die at night? Why wasn't the male owner at home? All the mysteries await the detective: Alice to solve. There is only one truth, let's find it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/c1adf74e3a648b94d58d2d573afdbc1c.poster.avif?t=1784868679\" width=1170 height=746 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/c1adf74e3a648b94d58d2d573afdbc1c.webm?t=1784868679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800860/extras/c1adf74e3a648b94d58d2d573afdbc1c.mp4?t=1784868679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>[<strong>Gameplay</strong>]</p><p c